# Dev server URL

Before opening the app in a browser, read the dev terminal and use the `Local:` URL printed there.

If more than one server is running, use the terminal the person has open and say which port that was.

Do not assume port 3000 or 3001. Next moves to the next free port when the usual one is already taken.
